== Hope Center Coalition ==
The [[Hope Center Coalition]] (Spanish: ''Coalición Centro Esperanza''), formerly known as the Coalition of Hope (Spanish: ''Coalición de la Esperanza'') until 28 November 2021,<ref>{{cite news |title=Humo blanco: nace Coalición Centro Esperanza para las elecciones presidenciales |url=https://www.elespectador.com/politica/humo-blanco-nace-coalicion-centro-esperanza-para-las-elecciones-presidenciales/ |newspaper=El Espectador |language=es |date=28 November 2021 |access-date=1 March 2022 |archive-date=1 March 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220301210753/https://www.elespectador.com/politica/humo-blanco-nace-coalicion-centro-esperanza-para-las-elecciones-presidenciales/ |url-status=live }}</ref> is a coalition of centre and centre-left politicians. Five pre-candidates announced that they would be standing for election as the unified presidential candidate for the coalition.<ref>{{cite news |title=Así quedó el orden del tarjetón de la consulta de la Coalición Centro Esperanza |url=https://www.elespectador.com/politica/elecciones-colombia-2022/asi-quedo-el-orden-del-tarjeton-de-la-consulta-de-la-coalicion-centro-esperanza/ |newspaper=El Espectador |language=es |date=2 February 2022 |access-date=1 March 2022 |archive-date=1 March 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220301175044/https://www.elespectador.com/politica/elecciones-colombia-2022/asi-quedo-el-orden-del-tarjeton-de-la-consulta-de-la-coalicion-centro-esperanza/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

